/-!
# A181985

Generalized Euler numbers. Square array A(n,k), n >= 1, k >= 0, read by antidiagonals. A(n,k) = n-alternating permutations of length n*k.

The 45 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A181985

